# Exception: the built database at repo root is committed as a deployment
# data artifact for S29 (Streamlit Community Cloud has no persistent disk
# and no build-time hook to run ingest/categorize/views itself - the repo
# it clones must already contain a ready database). The raw source
# workbook it's built from (data/raw/online_retail_II.xlsx) is already
# committed for the same reason, so this isn't a new category of
# committed data, just the processed form of what's already public here.
!/data_analyst_agent.duckdb

